  "_about": "Roadster cluster, generated by design/gen_roadster.py (edit that and regenerate): two classic round dials (shaders.js dial: chrome ring, ticks, an orange needle; speed 0..160 mph / 0..240 km/h, revs 0..7000 with the red band from the redline and the ring red at the shift point), the speed in figures in the speed dial, a chrome gear between them, the drive mode in the rev dial, six readout slots left and right (oil, coolant, fuel / boost, torque, power). Ends 16 px over BMW's own bottom strip, which shows under it. The rev dial ends left of BMW's black box. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
